<1.6.0>
- Removed raw account UUID and bank UUID from the account details menu.
- Added an admin button to view account transactions.
- Improved the SDB creation page:
  - replaced currency buttons with an arrow selector
  - replaced size buttons with image-based size options
- Added safety deposit box deletion with confirmation and inventory cleanup.
- Added admin door open/close bypass for bank doors.
- Added Discord webhook logging for bank activity.
- Added transaction log entries for more banking actions.
- Updated `bcc_safety_deposit_boxes.inventory_id` to `CHAR(40)` for `sdb_` UUID inventory IDs.
